      "contentPreview": "WRONG CLAIM 3: \u0027CompositeEventSinkTests / ThrowingSink is implicated (its warning is the last line before the crash).\u0027 FALSE. vstest only dumps the test host\u0027s BUFFERED stderr when a run aborts, so that block is the entire run\u0027s output printed at crash time, not a chronological tail. Position in it means nothing. CompositeEventSink correctly wraps every sink call in try/catch. The --filter exclusion of CompositeEventSinkTests only shifted timing; it was never causal.",
